  "text": "USTED LIBRARY catalog Skip to main content USTED LIBRARY Your cart is empty. Cart Lists Public lists Hospitality Auto Engineering Fashion Your lists Log in to create your own lists Log in to your account Your cookies Search history Catalogue New arrivals Repository Research Guides Hours Ask a Librarian Search the catalog by: Library catalog Title Author Subject ISBN ISSN Series Call number Search the catalog Advanced search Course reserves Authority search Tag cloud Libraries Log in to your account Card number or username: Password: Forgot your password? Home Opening hours Monday - Friday 9:00 AM – 10:00 PM Saturday 9:00 AM – 4:00 PM Sunday 2:00PM – 8:00PM NASKA II Library, Mampong [email protected] Koha home USTED LibCat · Public Access Catalogue Find books, journals and course materials across both campuses. Search the library's collections from any device. Place holds, build reading lists, and link straight through to licensed databases and open-access full text. 4,200+ Titles catalogued 2 Campus libraries 12k+ E-journals via CARLIGH Open now Main library, Kumasi Start here Library services & access points Library website E-Resources & Databases EBSCOhost, Wiley, JSTOR and other subscriptions via CARLIGH. Digital Repository Theses, dissertations and AAMUSTED research output, open access. Course Reserves Required and recommended texts set aside by your lecturers. Research Guides Subject guides, referencing help and information-literacy tutorials. Ask a Librarian Chat, email or visit the reference desk for research support. Just added to the shelves New arrivals Browse all new titles Managerial economics in a global economy Principles of economics An introduction to language and linguistics Food science and nutrition Linguistics : an introduction Advanced automotive fault diagnosis Curated by the library Featured collections List · Faculty of Technical Education Automotive & Engineering Essentials Core texts for workshop and diagnostics courses. 42 titles List · General Entrepreneurship Starter Shelf Business planning, finance and venture skills. 31 titles List · Past papers Examination Past Questions By department, for the last five academic years. 120 items List · Open access Free Full-Text Textbooks Vetted OER and open monographs from DOAB & OAPEN. 58 titles Login form Log in to your account: Card number or username: Password: Forgot your password? USTED Library Supporting teaching, learning and research at the University of Skills Training and Entrepreneurial Development. Catalogue Advanced search Course reserves Authority search Browse by subject Services E-resources Repository Research guides Ask a librarian Visit Opening hours Kumasi (Main) Mampong (NASKA II) University home © 2026 USTED Library, Kumasi, Ghana. Accessibility · Privacy & cookies · Library policies",
